{"v":3,"catch":"以戰鬥機飛行員身份投身當代戰場。","desc":"北約部隊正與歷史宿敵展開高強度衝突。\n\n身為北約聯合指揮部的飛行員，您將駕駛西方頂尖戰機（陣風、F18、F22、F35）並率領盟軍編隊（颱風、幻影等戰機）。\n\n你們必須在各種天氣條件下，協同作戰以殲滅敵方戰機及陸海目標。\n\n憑藉先進物理引擎的逼真表現與高解析度圖像，您將完整體驗西方現代戰鬥機飛行員的真實戰場感受","publisher":"Pix Arts","release":"2025-12-18","genres":["射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"保護級","size":"Switch 2 1.0GB / Switch 1.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/86967c3f16b09aaaf5e6840223dcb7f74a2e4acf2ce467e479452aefc5d3c8cd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/602eaf9dfbc21f41b68e7f09dde68ff9826c55fd480bf370ff9e55c4b7d10c6e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/daa88aa8c45ffacd60f802d203974a3d3c0d96786d35d144158b3ea99bc7430f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7f26ecb23e508def66288bece89d7d60cf79c79af8f92674679a43812926573f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/69cf1384d5ea5df829d52cae5ca96f79bcf7b4b68a211d0116314772df3592be.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/01eb074cc994e472edd18fe54e95170e1306366c20c41a6f8d73335bed566995.jpg"],"titleId":"0100dd6026562000","dlc":[]}